# clang-tidy settings for the fuzzers: the project's settings, with one
# change, as for the tests (tests/.clang-tidy).
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks:
  # check(x.has_value()) aborts when x is empty, but through a function
  # call, so this check can't see it and reports every later access. The
  # fuzzers read optionals with .value(), which throws on an empty one: an
  # uncaught exception, which libFuzzer reports, never undefined behaviour.
  - -bugprone-unchecked-optional-access
